WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.280
S4 Presents: It's our job to shine. {check}{check check}

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.240
We are your hosts.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.700
The four glimmering stars, S4!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.080
We'll lead off with fresh news.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:28.210
Four Star Academy recently held its annual S4 Selection.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.260
Every class brought their A game and battled fiercely. {or just A}{held held}{a[h]}

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.050
Just thinking about it sends a shiver down my spine!

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:39.760
In Dance Class, Yuzu delivered her second victory in as many years.{this is the first year she's keeping her title; she won it from someone else the first year}{tashikani}

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.640
First-year Saotome Ako-chan and Tsubasa had a close race to the finish in Theater Class.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.730
In the end, Tsubasa pulled a comfortable victory.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:53.110
Beauty Class gave us the academy's first-ever sister face-off.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:57.530
After an impassioned fight, 
Kasumi Mahiru-chan emerged on top.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:01.240
Finally, at the climax of Song Class's ferocious battle,

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.460
Hime shone as the brightest star.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:12.050
Going to my limits in this year's S4 Selection has made it one to remember.{less colorful, but structured in a way that Yozora's agreement in the next line makes sense}

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:19.600
Certainly. Especially how the new S4 will be crowned entirely of first- and second-years.{is this our first suspended hyphen?}{I usually don't do them}

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.270
And not just that! We're closing in on the next big event!

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.060
Right, Four Star Academy's...

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.060
Graduation!

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:11.750
Delicious.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.040
A decadent respite.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.090
Yeah.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.300
Say, would you hear me out without laughing?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:24.760
I couldn't help but imagine—
if this moment could last forever,{I know I know, but doesn't this actually?}{if you remove the comma and dash you need it, but with it like this you don't I think}

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.270
how wonderful it would be.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:30.230
Us four, together forever.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.400
That sounds great to me.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.940
But we have a responsibility to keep moving forward.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.990
We aren't permitted to falter. {different connotations?}

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.160
True... however.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.200
There's more than enough time for seconds.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.660
Sure!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.960
To conclude, we will hold the S4 Crowning.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:39.960
Each current member of S4 will say a few words and crown their successor.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.590
Let us begin with Dance Class.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.890
Wind Dance Class, Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.350
Okay!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:52.100
Nikaidou Yuzu here! I'd like to say something first!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.980
Everyone, thanks so much!

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:04.860
I've always believed that what's important in Aikatsu isn't just singing or dancing.{as in only}

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.200
What's most important is your friends.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:14.750
After all, it was only thanks to my friends that I was able to sparkle my brightest in S4 this past year.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:19.880
I want you all to create those same bonds for yourself.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.420
Yuzu.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.630
Yuzu-sama.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:26.510
Wait a second, why am I talking like I'm graduating myself?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.140
The crowning!

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.560
The crowning!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.390
Right, the crowning!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:37.190
Um, the new S4 rep is just me again.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.270
Looking forward to another year of it!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.530
Following is Bird Theater Class, Kisaragi Tsubasa.{uh}{huh}

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.280
Yes.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.780
Kisaragi Tsubasa of Theater Class.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:52.990
I...

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.790
I...

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:01.790
Forgive me. There is just one thing I'd like to convey.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:08.800
You may run into hardship somewhere along your path, 
but it is those times especially you must believe in yourself.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.310
Even in the wake of a bitter defeat,
remember that people can change.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:16.680
You can grow. So long as you have the will...

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:23.070
One day, you will find the place you are destined to illuminate.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.190
The new S4 representative of Theater Class is...

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.650
Saotome Ako!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.200
Y-Yes!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.580
Saotome, wear it well.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:45.000
I will pull Theater Class to greater heights in your stead.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:56.810
Next up is Moon Beauty Class, Kasumi Yozora!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.390
I'm Kasumi Yozora of Beauty Class.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:08.280
I can recall as if it were yesterday, the day I enrolled in 
Four Star Academy, dreams and expectations filling my breast.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:16.370
You may not have known, but there was a time I doubted whether I should have ever come here.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:25.250
I distressed over whether I had hurt someone dear 
to me, been misunderstood, and made her despair.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.260
But I was mistaken.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:34.260
I can now say with confidence that I wasn't wrong!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:42.770
Beauty Class's new S4 representative is Kasumi Mahiru!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.360
Yes!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.540
You've finally overtaken me.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.040
Onee-chan.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.540
It suits you perfectly.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.550
I am succeeding Kasumi Yozora in S4.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.930
I will do my utmost to uphold this title!

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:26.230
Last is Flower Song Class, Shiratori Hime.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:30.360
I am Shiratori Hime of Song Class.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:34.820
My three years at Four Star Academy were filled with irreplaceable experiences.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:41.290
Happy times, sad times, fun times, painful times,

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:44.540
and so many more that I cannot recount them all.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.710
Not a single day was without meaning.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.710
With my heart filled with gratitude for all that befell me,

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.470
I will set forth to a new stage.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:59.720
Illuminating the path ahead as the new S4 representative of Song Class will be...

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.970
Nijino Yume!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:02.850
Yes!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.730
Yume-chan, turn around.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.580
It looks wonderful on you, Yume-chan.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.450
Thank you.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:26.460
The new S4 is in your hands.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.710
Hime-senpai...

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.260
My dream is to join S4.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.760
I vowed to make it come true 
since before I came here.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:47.600
Unlike Hime-senpai, I may not be someone you can rely on just yet...

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.110
But I will come into my own in S4!

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.370
We'll now move into the photo session. The press can come forward.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.370
All right, let's get this going!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.130
We are stars.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.880
The Four Stars that light up the Aikatsu world.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.130
Tirelessly serving as shining beacons in the sky.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.130
The radiance of S4 is...

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.680
Eternal!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.390
The Crowning is now complete.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.190
I was so nervous.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.150
Well, I wasn't nervous in the slightest.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.230
You definitely were bold, Ako.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.900
Yeah, I was amazed.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:40.160
It's only natural. Those of S4 must be confident and hold their heads high—

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.910
Hey, boiled octopus!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.790
S-S-Subaru-kyun?!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.160
Talk about a complete one-eighty.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.250
What's up?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.170
Well, you know. Congrats on making S4.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.300
Thanks!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:58.920
Congrats... Subaru-kyun told me congrats!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.970
I see the party in your head rages on.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.680
Say that again?!

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:05.930
Come to think of it, aren't you coming from your graduation?

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:06.930
Yeah.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.940
But honestly, it didn't really feel like a graduation.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:14.440
M4 doesn't change members, 
and our unit will continue too.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.190
Besides, the high school's right over there.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.690
I see.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.950
In other words, we're true rivals starting now.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.040
I couldn't ask for more!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.000
Okay, we've got to head off now.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.330
See you, Nii-san.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.120
Sure.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.630
Subaru-kyun...

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.600
"Thank You Party"?{the urge}

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.310
It's a traditional event.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:52.060
S4 has one final show to thank all the remaining students and teachers for their support.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.600
How romantic.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:57.780
But we're the ones who should be thanking them for all their help.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.610
I've got it!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.130
We're late for move-in!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:20.800
This is entirely your own fault! Your absurd ideas cause us no end of trouble.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.630
You looked pretty on board with it to me.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.260
You need to look more carefully!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.260
You're late!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.560
We're sorry!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.890
Being in S4 is a constant fight against time.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:36.690
There's a boatload of things you must take care of before matriculation.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.070
Far more than there's time for.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.030
Okay, let's get moving.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.900
Huh? To where?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.780
First, you have the baton passing of S4 TV.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.700
Okay!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.290
Next, press conferences for your brands.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.710
Writing messages for the academy's pamphlet.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.640
There's still much more to go.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.550
Making the schedule for next year's events,

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:13.060
arranging your S4 commercial deals, 
organizing festivals and nationwide tours...

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.480
Then there's...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.810
Shall we take a break?

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:19.900
We can handle it!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.570
There's no time to complain.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.940
Yes, we're part of S4 now.{we s4 now girls}

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.860
Tsubasa-senpai, what's next on the agenda?

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.320
Next is appointing your admins.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.450
Our admins?

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.580
We appoint them ourselves? {the eternal question has been answered}{seems ripe for cronyism}

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.580
That's right.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:37.540
They bear the important responsibility of 
managing your entire class for the next year.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:42.300
Consider thoroughly who you think will be best for the job.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.590
Yes.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:47.720
Admins... that wasn't on my radar at all.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:51.890
They'll be serving for the entire year, so we need to choose carefully.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:53.720
I've decided.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.100
I'm gonna go and ask now.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.320
Rola!

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:09.490
Yume, I accept your offer to be a Song Class admin!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.990
But I haven't even asked yet!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.410
How did you know?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.950
It was inevitable.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:21.040
I'm the only person in Song Class you wouldn't feel bad about relying on.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.130
Am I wrong?

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:28.590
You've got it. You know me better than anyone else around. {this one's for you, Koharu}{but}

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.600
Let's breathe some new life into Song Class!{doesn't this sort of sound like she thinks it's currently dead?}{this should be better}

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.600
Yeah, the two of us together!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.810
Let's do it!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:42.190
So, I've got my first request. Could you 
come with me to ask one more pair to join?

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.190
Please...

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:45.480
We need you!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:49.030
Will you consider keeping your position as admins?

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.240
Congratulations!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.740
Does that mean?

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:55.490
Of course!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:58.000
We gladly accept!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.790
Thank you so much!

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:03.500
Okay, so there's something I need your help with right away.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.970
If I remember right...

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.760
Are you all ready?

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:17.310
This is gonna be the rockingest party!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:23.650
Tonight we'll put aside all the formalities and have as much fun as we can!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.190
Cheers!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.650
Cheers!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.070
It's already begun!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:30.820
Let's hurry!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:39.580
Tsubasa-senpai, with you going off to the 
high school, dorm life will be so much duller.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.790
Please give us that line one last time!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.920
Very well.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.790
It's Punishment Time!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.300
It's Reward Time!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.850
I brought enough ramune to go around, don't hold back.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:55.800
Okay!

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.850
What's one plus two?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.180
Three!{..................................}{don't you remember what I did for Mahiru?}

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:02.140
I'm so honored! This'll be a family heirloom!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.400
Who'd like to go next?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.810
Yes, I would!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:05.810
Me!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:06.690
Me too!

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.690
There's plenty of time. No need to push.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.450
Here you are. Eat up while it's still hot.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.200
Okay!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.370
Thank you.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.330
What do you think?

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.410
It's spicy!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:21.250
But it's really good!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.170
I'll work hard to try and reach your level!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.210
Thank you!

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.710
Mikki, congratulations on graduating.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:33.470
It's an honor to receive such words from you.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:38.220
But truthfully, I'm far too worried about you to feel like graduating.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.140
You can trust me to take care of everything.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.560
But by yourself...

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.850
Don't worry, don't worry! Haruka's here too!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.610
That concerns me even more!

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:48.730
Wait...

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.650
Huh? Where's Yuzu-sama?

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.400
Yuzu-sama disappeared!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.240
Unbelievable!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.830
Goodness, she's troubling to the very end.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.240
Let's go, girls!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.250
Find Yuzu-sama!

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.760
I knew we'd find you here.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.390
I wanted to ground myself before our performance.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.560
So did I.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.890
Me too!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.270
It's the same as back then.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.530
Right before we first took the stage together.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.660
That's right.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:46.540
I've never told you, but there were times when I was scared of going on stage back then. {holy shit I can't believe I caught this rare-ass grammatical formation in my last pass}

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.290
Once you're up there...

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:51.040
Nobody can save you.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.550
You can't rely on anyone else.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.550
It's lonely by yourself.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:00.550
So we all felt the same way.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:05.430
So much has happened in this past year.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.890
Fun things and painful things.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.150
Happy things and sad things.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.030
Things you want to escape and things you want to overcome.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.660
Things that almost crush you and things you want to dive into.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.540
And through them all, I could feel it.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.330
I was by myself, but never alone.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:30.420
You were all right there next to me.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:37.590
I wonder what awaits us in the future.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:42.220
There will surely be both wonderful things and difficult things.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.260
We'll be fine no matter what comes at us.{I'm proud, you've taken the mantle of characterizing Yuzu}

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:47.730
Even if we're apart, our hearts are connected.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.230
Yeah, we're the same as this tree.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:57.610
No matter how far the branches spread, they're all connected at the roots.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.830
Whatever future awaits us, we'll be fine.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.750
This place, these feelings...

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.250
The time we shared as S4...

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.510
...will guide the way.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.560
Are you prepared? {I can't believe I needed to explicitly tell you this was from the song}

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.650
Absolutely.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.440
Yes.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.610
Here we go.

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:37.530
For everything we've been, and for everything we will be.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.530
The greatest performance!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:40.400
Everyone, thank you for all you've done for us!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.190
